Each of these files starts with a comment naming the upstream file it comes from.

Modifications by hattisar:
- compose.yml (from docker/docker-compose.yml) keeps only the db, meta, studio and supavisor
  services, pins internal ports, drops environment for services not in the stack, uses named
  volumes, lowers supavisor's RLIMIT_NOFILE, and adds the hattisar and docker-proxy services.
- volumes/db/roles.sql sets a password only for the pgbouncer role (used by supavisor's
  auth_query); the roles of absent services keep no password.
- volumes/db/_supabase.sql, volumes/db/pooler.sql and volumes/pooler/pooler.exs are unmodified
  apart from the header comment.
